WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.211
I care about you like so.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.131
It's ok.

00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:18.602
Oh fuck.

00:00:20.521 --> 00:00:21.647
You need a hand
with any of this?

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.524
-No, I'm good.
-Alright.

00:00:23.607 --> 00:00:26.151
I'm Theo by the way.
What's your name?

00:00:26.235 --> 00:00:28.529
I'm married
and have these groceries.

00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:29.780
They're for my baby.

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:32.115
You.

00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:33.367
What are you doing here?

00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:35.661
I own the place.

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:37.704
So, you got a new town,

00:00:38.205 --> 00:00:39.289
new baby,

00:00:39.915 --> 00:00:41.166
new bakery,

00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:42.626
banging body.

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:46.088
You're just doing it all.

00:00:46.922 --> 00:00:47.798
Stop that.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.049
Stop what?

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:50.133
Flirting.

00:00:50.217 --> 00:00:53.470
Ok, so my house is swarming
with reporters

00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:57.432
so I did jump my fence
to go get some lunch.

00:00:57.516 --> 00:01:01.687
Which is also the story
of why I forgot my wallet.

00:01:02.688 --> 00:01:07.109
And now I'm gonna die
starving in destitute.

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:08.402
My issue is that
you're still flirting

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:09.695
and I asked you not to.

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:13.532
I'm not flirting with you,
I'm begging you for food.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:19.413
If you need some cheap to
free labour at the bakery,

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:20.789
I'm your guy.

00:01:20.873 --> 00:01:23.125
Yeah, come
whenever you want.

00:01:29.673 --> 00:01:30.841
Hey, stop.

00:01:31.383 --> 00:01:32.301
What the fuck?

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:34.219
What the fuck are you doing!

00:01:34.303 --> 00:01:35.512
I thought it would
get your attention.

00:01:35.596 --> 00:01:36.430
What the fuck!

00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:38.056
Come on, this shit's
romantic as fuck.

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:39.016
What are you talking about?

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:41.977
Well, according to all the
romcoms of your generation

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.353
this is what the guys
are supposed to do

00:01:43.437 --> 00:01:44.438
to get the girl.

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:50.194
I'm sorry.

00:01:50.277 --> 00:01:51.153
That's my bad.

00:01:51.236 --> 00:01:52.654
You know,

00:01:52.738 --> 00:01:56.116
it's not the most subtle
come here of my life,

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:59.703
but I'm really, I'm not
complaining about it.

00:02:01.288 --> 00:02:02.831
I don't know
what you're talking about.

00:02:06.001 --> 00:02:08.128
Does terrible family tragedy

00:02:08.212 --> 00:02:10.088
make people more fuckable?

00:02:10.589 --> 00:02:13.800
'Cause could really use
a silver lining.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:26.522
-Don't do that.
-Yeah.

00:02:28.273 --> 00:02:29.608
The fuck.
What are you doing here?

00:02:29.691 --> 00:02:30.817
You called me.

00:02:31.485 --> 00:02:33.445
You drunk dialled me
at like 4am.

00:02:33.529 --> 00:02:36.657
I was worried, so I Uberd.

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:38.075
I can't stop
thinking about you.

00:02:39.743 --> 00:02:40.869
While I'm being honest.

00:02:41.495 --> 00:02:43.664
It's really hard to stand
here and have a conversation

00:02:43.747 --> 00:02:46.124
with you as though I'm not
like totally distracted

00:02:46.208 --> 00:02:47.167
by how much I want you.

00:02:56.134 --> 00:02:57.386
If you want me to shut up,
I will.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:02:59.888
I'm not trying
to be an asshole.

00:03:00.889 --> 00:03:02.599
I'm just trying
to figure out...

00:03:05.269 --> 00:03:08.522
how I can focus
when all I want is you.

00:03:08.605 --> 00:03:10.858
You shut up.

00:03:11.817 --> 00:03:12.818
No.

00:03:37.551 --> 00:03:38.552
Are you sure?

00:03:42.181 --> 00:03:43.223
Run away with me, Love?

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.643
I care about you like so.

00:03:48.896 --> 00:03:50.147
I love you.

00:03:51.148 --> 00:03:52.774
I can't stand it.

00:03:54.484 --> 00:03:55.777
I need you to leave.

00:03:57.487 --> 00:03:59.031
I need you to leave
Madre Linda

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:02.534
-and never come back.
-Come with me then.

00:04:06.371 --> 00:04:07.414
I can't.

00:04:10.584 --> 00:04:11.502
Goodbye, Love.

00:04:15.881 --> 00:04:17.132
Theo, wait...

